{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44112","headline":"和赵光远题壁 · 杨莱儿","name":"和赵光远题壁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长者车尘每到门，长卿非慕卓王孙。\n定知羽翼难随凤，却喜波涛未化鲲。\n娇别翠钿黏去袂，醉歌金雀碎残尊。\n多情多病年应促，早办名香爲返魂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨莱儿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44112.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44112","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}